# um-texts 1
=== SPELL detect_life
Life Detection
Allows the target to sense all creatures within a certain radius.

=== SPELL ensorcell
Charm
The most powerful astral spell. It dopes a creature, causing it to fall in love with the caster.

=== SPELL fireraze
Sacrifice to Fire
Deals massive damage to everyone around the caster, including the caster.

=== SPELL lichdom
Necrosis
Allows the target to become less detectable by life.

=== SPELL link
Lien
Permet de lier les réserves d'énergie magique de deux mages.

=== SPELL necro
Summon Undead
Summons an undead to a specified location.

=== SPELL panic
Charisma
The target of this spell gains the ability to use more complex magic.

=== SPELL possession
Possession
Focuses senses on a target so much that perceiving the world as it becomes possible.

=== SPELL stench
Distortion
The target affected by this spell becomes more visible to all types of perception.

